{"seq":1,"slug":"product-card-timeline","title":"商品卡按讲解时间轴投放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/live-commerce-systems/streaming-cards/product-card-timeline","wordCount":2810,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品卡按讲解时间轴投放\">商品卡按讲解时间轴投放</h1><p>直播间的商品卡不是挂在页面两侧等人来点的静态组件。它的正确形态是一条<strong>由讲解事件驱动的投放时间轴</strong>：主播讲到哪件商品，对应的卡片就出现在画面里；讲完切下一件，上一张卡片收回商品袋。用户不需要自己去列表里找，因为列表里的排序就是讲解顺序，而卡片是当前那一项的放大版。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-投放窗口\">核心概念：投放窗口</h2><p>把「卡片什么时候出现在屏幕上」抽象成一个时间区间，问题就变得可计算了。定义 <strong>投放窗口（placement window）</strong> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{start}, t_{end})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{start}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是卡片进入画面的时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{end}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它被收回的时刻。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{start} = t_{explain}^{server} + \\Delta_{dispatch} + \\Delta_{network} + \\Delta_{render}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0975em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个延迟项分别对应服务端下发、网络传输、客户端渲染。工程上要控制的是后两项的<strong>方差</strong>而不是均值：如果所有用户的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{network}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都是 200ms，那主播口播后 200ms 所有人同时看到卡片，体验是一致的；如果方差很大（有人 100ms 有人 3000ms），就会出现一部分用户已经在抢购而另一部分还不知道发生了什么。</p>\n<p>窗口的结束条件比开始复杂。理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{end}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应该是讲解结束事件的到达时刻，但实践中必须处理三种情况：<strong>讲解结束事件丢失</strong>（需要看门狗超时）、<strong>主播连续讲解同一商品</strong>（窗口应延长而非重开）、以及<strong>秒杀卡片抢占</strong>（见下节）。因此窗口的结束时刻由三个来源竞争决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{end} = \\min\\left(t_{explain\\_end} + \\epsilon_{grace},\\ t_{watchdog},\\ t_{preempt}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.217em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_{grace}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个宽限期（例如 2 秒），让用户在讲解结束后还有一点时间完成点击——主播说「这件讲完了」的瞬间把卡片抽走，正在点击的用户会很恼火。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{watchdog}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是兜底超时。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{preempt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是优先级更高的卡片抢占的时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间轴的建模与存储\">时间轴的建模与存储</h2><p>投放时间轴需要被持久化吗？答案是<strong>部分需要</strong>。实时投放靠事件流就够，但有两个场景需要回放历史时间轴：一是新进入直播间的用户需要看到「当前讲解的是什么」以及「之前讲过什么」，二是事后分析需要知道每个时刻屏幕上是什么卡片（用于计算曝光与转化）。</p>\n<p>存储模型有两种选择，取舍点在于「按用户查」还是「按房间查」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件流</td>\n<td>按 <code>room_id</code> 分区的有序事件日志</td>\n<td>天然保序、可回放、写入快</td>\n<td>查询某时刻状态需重放或快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态快照 + 增量</td>\n<td>定期快照 + 后续增量</td>\n<td>查询快、新用户加载快</td>\n<td>快照与增量需版本对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化时间轴</td>\n<td>按房间写一行行窗口记录</td>\n<td>分析友好</td>\n<td>写放大、实时性差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中通常用<strong>事件流 + 周期快照</strong>：事件流是真相源，每 10 秒（或每 50 个事件）打一个状态快照，新用户进入时读最近快照再重放其后的事件。这与 <a href=\"../live-room-catalog/live-room-product-list\">直播间商品列表与上下架</a> 里客户端「全量快照 + 增量事件」的同步模型是同一套思路，只是那一个针对商品袋，这一个针对卡片时间轴。</p>\n<p>物化时间轴只用于离线分析，不用于在线服务——它的写放大会在洪峰期成为负担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡片下发的批量与去重\">卡片下发的批量与去重</h2><p>一个常见的性能陷阱是<strong>每个用户单独下发卡片数据</strong>。看似合理（每个用户的客户端状态不同），实则浪费巨大：同一房间十万用户，当前讲解的是同一件商品，卡片内容完全相同。如果每条下发都携带完整的商品对象（标题、图片 URL、价格、库存），十万次下发就是十万次序列化与十万倍的带宽。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是<strong>内容与状态分离</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[讲解事件流] --&gt; B[卡片内容分发&lt;br/&gt;房间级广播, 极小 payload]&#10;    B --&gt; C[客户端本地卡片池]&#10;    D[用户级状态&lt;br/&gt;是否已购/是否已领券] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[渲染当前卡片]&#10;    B --&gt; F[listing_id + action + version]&#10;    F --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[讲解事件流] --&gt; B[卡片内容分发&lt;br/&gt;房间级广播, 极小 payload]\n    B --&gt; C[客户端本地卡片池]\n    D[用户级状态&lt;br/&gt;是否已购/是否已领券] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[渲染当前卡片]\n    B --&gt; F[listing_id + action + version]\n    F --&gt; C</pre><p>房间级广播只带 <code>listing_id</code>、<code>action</code>（显示/隐藏/置顶）与版本号。卡片的<strong>内容</strong>（标题、图、价）来自客户端已缓存的商品袋数据——用户在进入直播间时已经拉过全量商品袋，卡片的渲染数据就在本地。用户级状态（是否已购买该商品、是否有可用券）才需要单独计算，且这类数据通常可以在点击时按需拉取，不必在投放时预取。</p>\n<p>这个分离带来一个必须处理的问题：<strong>客户端缓存可能缺失</strong>。用户刚进入直播间、商品袋快照还没到，此时收到卡片投放事件，本地没有对应商品数据。处理方式是卡片先渲染骨架屏并标记待补，商品袋到达后补齐。绝不能因为缺数据就丢弃事件——丢弃会导致这张卡片永远不出现，是比骨架屏严重得多的故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投放时序与秒杀卡片的优先级\">投放时序与秒杀卡片的优先级</h2><p>最需要精细处理的是<strong>讲解卡与秒杀卡的共存</strong>。主播讲解某件商品时，可能同时有另一件商品的秒杀正在进行（一场直播里多个商品轮流开抢是常态）。此时屏幕上只能有一张主卡，谁赢？</p>\n<p>规则不能简单按「后到的赢」或「固定的优先级」，因为两种极端都不对。固定优先级会让讲解完全被秒杀压制（用户看不到主播在讲什么）；后到优先会让秒杀卡片被讲解打断（用户正在抢购时卡片被换掉，直接导致下单中断）。</p>\n<p>合理的仲裁规则是<strong>按卡片的时效性分级</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卡片类型</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>抢占行为</th>\n<th>抢占窗口限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>秒杀进行中</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>可抢占讲解卡</td>\n<td>只在剩余时间 &gt; 5s 时可被抢占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>讲解中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可抢占预告卡与已结束的秒杀</td>\n<td>不抢占进行中的秒杀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预告</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不抢占任何卡片</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已售罄提示</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可短暂覆盖（3s）</td>\n<td>自动收起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「剩余时间 &gt; 5s 时可被抢占」这一行是关键。秒杀快结束时（最后 5 秒）是转化最密集的时刻，此时任何打断都会伤害转化率。这条规则意味着即使有一件商品开始讲解，也要等当前秒杀结束后 5 秒才能显示讲解卡——这 5 秒的等待对用户是无感的（他们的注意力在秒杀倒计时上），对转化是有利的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[新卡片投放请求] --&gt; B{当前有卡片显示?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[直接投放]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{新卡优先级 &gt; 当前卡?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[排队等待]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{当前卡是进行中秒杀&lt;br/&gt;且剩余 &gt; 5s?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| E&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[收回当前卡并入袋]&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    E --&gt; H[当前卡释放后投放]\">flowchart TD\n    A[新卡片投放请求] --&gt; B{当前有卡片显示?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[直接投放]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{新卡优先级 &gt; 当前卡?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[排队等待]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{当前卡是进行中秒杀&lt;br/&gt;且剩余 &gt; 5s?}\n    F --&gt;|否| E\n    F --&gt;|是| G[收回当前卡并入袋]\n    G --&gt; C\n    E --&gt; H[当前卡释放后投放]</pre><p>仲裁逻辑必须放在<strong>服务端</strong>而不是客户端。放在客户端看似能减少服务端复杂度，但会引入严重的不一致：不同客户端对同一时刻的仲裁结果可能不同（本地时钟差异、事件到达顺序差异），导致直播间里的用户看到不同的卡片，运营复盘时无法解释。服务端仲裁后下发一条权威的「当前主卡」指令，客户端只负责渲染，这是唯一能保证一致性的划分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡片曝光与点击的可观测性\">卡片曝光与点击的可观测性</h2><p>投放系统的效果衡量依赖准确的曝光数据。「曝光」的定义在不同团队间经常有分歧，必须先统一：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>下发曝光</strong>：服务端发出投放事件即计数。最简单，但会高估——客户端可能根本没渲染（网络延迟导致卡片在窗口结束后才到）。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染曝光</strong>：客户端实际渲染出卡片时上报。较准确，但上报通道可能丢事件。</li>\n<li><strong>可见曝光</strong>：卡片在视口内持续可见超过阈值（例如 500ms）才计数。最接近「用户真的看到了」，也是广告行业的标准口径。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>直播场景下推荐用<strong>可见曝光</strong>。理由是直播间画面里卡片是叠加在视频流上的，用户可能因为盯着主播的脸而完全没注意到角落的卡片——渲染了但没看见。500ms 的可见阈值能过滤掉滑动、闪屏等无效曝光。这里的阈值可以对齐行业标准口径：IAB/MRC 的可见曝光测量指南定义展示广告为「广告至少 50% 的像素位于可见区域的连续 1 秒」，视频广告为「播放连续 2 秒」（来源：IAB/MRC Viewable Ad Impression Measurement Guidelines, <a href=\"https://www.iab.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/MRC-Viewable-Ad-Impression-Measurement-Guideline.pdf）。直播卡片是叠层而非独立广告位，因此常取比\">https://www.iab.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/MRC-Viewable-Ad-Impression-Measurement-Guideline.pdf）。直播卡片是叠层而非独立广告位，因此常取比</a> 1 秒更短的门槛以贴近「看到即计」，但「必须同时约定像素占比与持续时间」这一点是一致的。</p>\n<p>上报本身也要节流。十万用户的曝光上报如果逐条发送，会形成新的洪峰。做法是<strong>客户端聚合上报</strong>：本地累积若干条曝光记录，按固定间隔（例如 5 秒）批量发送，服务端按 <code>(listing_id, 时间窗)</code> 聚合计数。这与下一章讨论的点赞聚合是同一类问题，见 <a href=\"../interact-order/comment-like-realtime\">弹幕/点赞/抽奖实时通道</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>投放下发量</td>\n<td>服务端发出的事件数</td>\n<td>系统健康度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染量</td>\n<td>客户端渲染成功数</td>\n<td>客户端性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见曝光量</td>\n<td>可见 &gt; 500ms 的次数</td>\n<td>效果衡量基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡片点击率</td>\n<td>点击 / 可见曝光</td>\n<td>选品与排序优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光到点击延迟</td>\n<td>可见到点击的时间差</td>\n<td>判断卡片吸引力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的「曝光到点击延迟」是一个很有信息量的指标。如果某商品的平均延迟很长（用户看了 20 秒才点），说明卡片没有说服力，用户是被主播的话术打动而非卡片本身；反之如果延迟很短（1-2 秒），说明卡片一出现就抓住了注意力。这个指标回流到选品系统，帮助判断哪些商品的卡片设计需要优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商品卡的本质是<strong>投放窗口</strong>，起点由讲解事件加三级延迟构成，终点由结束事件、看门狗、抢占三者竞争决定。</li>\n<li>时间轴存储用「事件流为真相源 + 周期快照加速加载」，物化时间轴只用于离线分析。</li>\n<li>卡片下发必须<strong>内容与状态分离</strong>：房间级广播只带 <code>listing_id</code> 与动作，内容来自客户端已缓存的商品袋。</li>\n<li>卡片仲裁必须在<strong>服务端</strong>完成，按时效性分级；进行中的秒杀只在剩余时间充裕时才可被抢占。</li>\n<li>曝光口径统一为「可见 &gt; 500ms」，上报走客户端聚合批发送，避免形成二次洪峰。</li>\n<li>投放窗口的起点由讲解事件驱动，事件的可靠扇出是窗口准时开始的前提，见 <a href=\"../live-room-catalog/explaining-item\">讲解中商品高亮与跳转</a>。</li>\n<li>同屏多卡的仲裁规则与弹窗频控在下一篇展开，见 <a href=\"pin-card-interaction\">置顶卡/弹窗与点击交互</a>。</li>\n<li>曝光数据同时是归因与 GPM 的分母，口径必须与归因系统共用，见 <a href=\"../interact-order/live-order-attribution\">直播间订单归因与数据回流</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品卡按讲解时间轴投放","id":"商品卡按讲解时间轴投放"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：投放窗口","id":"核心概念-投放窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"时间轴的建模与存储","id":"时间轴的建模与存储"},{"level":2,"text":"卡片下发的批量与去重","id":"卡片下发的批量与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"投放时序与秒杀卡片的优先级","id":"投放时序与秒杀卡片的优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"卡片曝光与点击的可观测性","id":"卡片曝光与点击的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直播专属价与改价实时生效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/live-commerce-systems/live-flash-sale/live-price-dynamic"},"next":{"title":"置顶卡/弹窗与点击交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/live-commerce-systems/streaming-cards/pin-card-interaction"}}